cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TeleEP: open-source analysis of implantable telemetry ECG"
abstract: >-
  TeleEP converts DSI Ponemah telemetry recordings to EDF+, filters them, detects QRS complexes and
  P waves (including in atrioventricular block), and computes RR and PP interval series and heart rate
  variability, with CSV, Excel and JSON export and an interactive browser-based viewer.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Joshua Kyungjoon
    family-names: Cho
  - given-names: Hee Cheol
    family-names: Cho
    affiliation: "Johns Hopkins University School of Medicine"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - ECG
  - telemetry
  - heart rate variability
  - EDF
  - atrioventricular block
  - sinus node dysfunction
